{"title":"Basilisk Scale","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Elder Basilisk, Sand Basilisk</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"elder-basilisk\" title=\"Elder Basilisk - dropped it in 18 of 20 looted corpses (1/1.1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/21648078e1e018261d8c.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Elder Basilisk</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.1<br>×1–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"sand-basilisk\" title=\"Sand Basilisk - dropped it in 1 of 4 looted corpses (1/4)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/21be7e1c2525957ceb69.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sand Basilisk</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×2</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"basilisk-scale\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/armor-smithing\">Armor smithing</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Used to make</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><a href=\"#/item/basilisk-feet\">Basilisk Feet</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Armor Smithing 31</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/basilisk-arms\">Basilisk Arms</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Armor Smithing 33</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/basilisk-head\">Basilisk Head</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Armor Smithing 35</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/basilisk-legs\">Basilisk Legs</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Armor Smithing 37</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/basilisk-torso\">Basilisk Torso</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Armor Smithing 41</span></li></ul>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/a5ed9e1dc0e4fec30424.svg\" alt=\"Basilisk Scale\"></div><h3>Basilisk Scale</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      <tr><th>Used in</th><td>5 recipes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/14/2026, 10:06:05 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}